  "body": "The geometry spec has been updated to make `WebKitCSSMatrix` a historical alias to `DOMMatrix`, and all the differences from #19 have been addressed there.\n\nAny future bugs on WebKitCSSMatrix compat spec stuff should be opened against the Geometry spec: https://drafts.fxtf.org/geometry/ (click on bottom right bug link thingy).\n",
